{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 934,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a85388c785c35e9306d70b97",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段余力十足的话\\n迅速向前突进\\n＜居中・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e83d7deba37d06c568e131d5a5c5fbb960a26d5982670f6b89561d4bc9a79a62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107601211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2a1acab86fcbb16010b69bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "耐力极为充足时，耐力与\n速度大幅提升<中距离/长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a936f201cfa56f0b766547198fb996dd85a62b327daaaf5928af65dcbfec6ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107602111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77ba6ddfbc4bfe7057d8d886",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段试图超越时\n速度大幅提升\n之后在最后冲刺过程中\n速度稍微提升<居中·长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "8290b695b3260c85adad25a1f271f82990d639b6da5547c22766cd7210ba8c05",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107602211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4904913e8ccd0f520fb37224",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "力量和速度少量提升\\n若马场状态为「良」则大幅提升力量和速度\\n＜草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cc7e27b984754032bf79028dc3336e9c87c2fccaca7be4ac72f4c3b261d90b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107701111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8d0bd40fe5a5e44b0753a18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛临近终盘时若在队伍前方\\n则提升速度,并在之后最终冲刺时\\n稍微提升加速度＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d6a9581eeb20eff4456a7a625227d00be6ec5b092201432a931c5014d9841bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107701211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a4ea8c542738367164a602d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘初期大幅回复耐力＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "81eac8f1e883764b855d2088a751a956639eacdfcbcf5d7c638dc9189b41a05c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107702111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c456c4079a7f2f54bb8047ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时,大幅消耗耐力\\n并在一段时间内大幅提升速度＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "19bc9700263ac7eeac9428d555cabad166eae4fc30d697deec55044aa5a31835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107702211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55c689b29e792d105d3779c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘开始时大幅向前突进\\n并稍微回复耐力＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebc8d550aa6d20fca8d836ebe1b6ac6b9b8195319b55c685ac3417066930ed99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107703111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf499d61c84377f139c74a2e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘开始时若余力充足则向前\\n突进，随后在最终直道上稍微\\n向前突进＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba7a77baf8a83d308c6f703eb0f82535ac77a7b730eb406863c49cbcd8dc48d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107703211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ced78ba8c68c919b12e06cc5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则一段时间内速度持续提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "25d7eb2abba4a5969c476b5ad7dde9710acc568b354dc0f24d4f1f7a907e13bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107801111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d14d96999068a76520885ca3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘、身处第二名之后的位置\\n并且距离领先位置距离在两马身以内时\\n速度持续提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "028fcff777d6d334a0066461e4dc4fbe0b2109ef5d78a580a013feae8b6ba07a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107801211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcefcc13607c1f9f6f699532",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段位于第三名开外时\\n一段时间内速度提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "484a3570d91c702140125f8fd29227c6638fcc4ec87c717633a653708503387c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107801221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14ffd166085b53b78c8aa2f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n一段时间内速度提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a92ad5b0b1d57edc33c989f594081a37ca0be0ce6b318b6ad9517314961cc85",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107802111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf61ef39e6d5a5188958b196",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即将进入终盘的位置以及往后\\n若位于第一或者距离第一名4马身以内时\\n一段时间内速度少量提升＜先行・英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "22106479693ce978ede07bee8dd3426370b9e0c3fdfab1e93bc22d60c2d00469",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107802211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c48405fe87ec5df58fcb47fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的直线上速度提升\\n若是泥地比赛则一段时间内\\n速度提升＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f42493b271a968340d2cfa603bf47db2f75d0c520359a3344a07121e95bd0354",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107901111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b62597247557d26a42cd84",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若进行了冲刺比拼,比赛进入最后200m时\\n大幅向前突进＜领放/先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "69b8ac1dc4f2db32f2a1bdb6343196ce1b809861e6759b0dd0d24c1642a12ba6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "107901211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8fa64044c729066ede07926",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛序盘发动多个技能时,提升加速度\\n如果比赛为英里或中距离\\n则技能效果增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "6794e6273f520292f7fd7e0a54dbddd38eb99085a16d6e11dba2dc6a987ed49e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108001111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da0ca6cfa7988d0ce1a93ccf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近中盘若位于前方\\n则大幅提升速度＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "108e685331d8f02dd4d2b75db7dd3a6c3fc09e205274bdaf8445ea1968a66968",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108001211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f378aa5e5ce975802693cc08",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛序盘多次发动技能\\n则加速力会提升，若未晚出发\\n之后会在最终冲刺时\\n少量提升加速力＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "535a6e138aa913e172ca8aac449fb2c0f6c312e4b095a0646b3862ade45f7f8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108002111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd8a8f8a2f4e0667fe16b203",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道前的第3弯道\\n位于前方则会向前冲出，之后\\n当对手赛马娘发动速度技能时\\n会小幅向前冲出＜泥地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "378d67b2a4818d610b81d66f924fd31e2dfe545d34ac82b246a753e37313b8dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108002211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1aa2ced30dcca9717ecb543",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的初期位于前方时\\n加速力会提升，在1800m及以下的\\n比赛中，则会在终盘初期的较早阶段\\n提升加速力＜泥地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ae62fe5bd74c78605929eb8739a2240721dfdef48759fc686d4a569565da6de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108101111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a7f7fe173bcb60d8b51d596",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘消耗少量耐力\\n在一段时间内大幅提升速度\\n＜泥地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ba6463480196fc9fd4f10e75671bbff1b691fbf681c9d877e29718727feffd5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108101211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3363cff5a8d28f31e5a0ca52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘超过别人时,一段时间内\\n速度提升,若智力有十二分聪慧时\\n技能效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a58f8fe0903e9e53fec87d06b4d3e66dbe2d116e018def0cb3b98ebc82a33ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108201111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e32379e9b59b676473d95d52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在刚进入比赛终盘时,若位于前方\\n则加速度提升,在之后剩余200m位置\\n速度稍微提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9f5daf218baf3529a96927f19300e10b068f4867b4a726781209cca0d08f8f6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108201211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a930590bc87d13889396a9df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时若位于中间集团以后\\n速度提升,之后在最终直线上\\n消耗少量持久力,稍微向前突进\\n＜追赶・英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca008b21147ec504ef63f4f5f15bd7d65c62c11050e2bc703767edb3cc05af3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108202111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:002759b95d53b307b49d03a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若直到比赛后半阶段一直保持在后方\\n则在终盘初段更早时间内提升加速力\\n之后在最终盘初段\\n微幅向前突进＜追赶・英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f283d6cc79530b7be2da4ae7987a45cda5376bcf907b9d19b519d372a9ef66f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108202211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c7f048f929b19796c517052",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终冲刺时位于中间集团往后\\n则消耗少量耐力来提升加速度,如果在中山竞马场\\n则不产生消耗并回复少量体力＜居中・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5071477e611f9aaefbb592eb56d191c87b259d629565418766fab5b9aa4803c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108301111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a134e9a4d926bbdf8682c70",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘位于后方时\\n速度提升并回复少量体力＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e9657193e745976e4ebc311c76507c3b3ca186f4cbd4bfcf8c0e82e41ce451b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108301211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de1248efee965332d8216b9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘,在中间集团竞争时\\n少量恢复体力,并大幅提升速度\\n稍微提升除自身外的己方队伍成员速度\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6df853c3045dfd6b082053fe96783f50ecac13b0fe85797f96f6258cd3ebeccd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108302111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18712844537b35a288e85987",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段位于队伍中后方时\\n一段时间内加速度提升\\n＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "db843e24189ccfcb674629a4c947b7e117f45abb70839cc39c74ba4c14d12afb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108302211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca22074b4b63d3c8e6ee328f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘位于后方时\\n最后冲刺的关键时刻速度大幅加快\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "de8d15abdbec244d4729d6258a56162b891258908cf97da424921fe78e50400d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108401111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66cee5f27ccff463474df0ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "速度和力量都十分强劲时\\n大幅提升速度和力量\\n＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3caf4eb19b8af356bd612b7cc4889ad53d5505c6ab8f692bf97db774ee190927",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108401211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbad8ae6f352970ebfe045b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近中盘时稍微放慢速度\\n之后在比赛终盘初期若位于后方\\n则加速度提升＜作战・英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "55bf00d223077efb08beeaccf8ee72015600bb1adbb17ef4bb65578a2e6bf111",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108402111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dbd8ce519e85f8a1b61b7b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘的最终直线上\\n一段时间内速度提升\\n若是英里比赛则改变效果\\n一段时间内向前突进＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0e7c40cf2f1d4c4c43c5ee603d8fce04b3776cee4ec803527f8973d80edba8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108402211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3abd0843eb92da4c798f8878",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道位于中间往后位置时\\n令前后各3名赛马娘的速度稍微下降\\n并大幅提高自己的速度＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "54ccbe7e4b70d55cd9bb964f66404f00857dd805d43fb1d339c820e30020b70e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108501111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b56972efe2613887e6cca9a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道处于中间集团或以后时\\n会大幅向前冲出，若能冷静地奔跑\\n则会巨量向前冲出＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0746786ed71edfbddee5e1354fb1e19ae8d7d284b02e4a748fe2b852506d7512",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108501121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:334a4699dc3e4f8d4d90d12b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘在后方准备超越时\\n提升加速度\\n并稍微威慑眼前的赛马娘＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c463f21ac59a5d9e4469a2ebaf409c8b6431682757cdb3a9b716731fefa9296",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108501211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6ccc7bbe9e1370b98119a11",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘一开始准备超越时\\n亦或者在比赛终盘初段\\n提升加速度＜居中・英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "36bc249d52ccc41e06701b03860c177e3364eb19bcff956d5b36cf2fee5233d9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108502111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed4cdfe8d5df95301b83e20d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时\\n若位于中后方则一段时间内速度提升\\n＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2338b1cb71c01c6b38230397cdfb0dad800ce55d3b8273a770931e3e298f177",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108502211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e16c090ce3d6bda46b66e95e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "位于最终弯道前的第三弯道时\\n若在队伍前方则迅速向前突进\\n＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "896c0d41cc8e74ec5a9dc3bb8dde971b55d8331350b246947558973f9d03081f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108601111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed9be2057cd9dc872bcdaf4f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘一段时间内提升速度\\n＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "eada362c2cc3cc04ea61f7bcf30a3b91d62b27de84b8eff4a11594a97072b3e0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108601211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e300650883a0ed4e3e9cf6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度大幅提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "720a6e4102e5efc5dce90b41965b4773ec62e337bb3f7c4c50631b8e9d03025b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108602111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c341a8f67b63f3cf72bbb57",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘位于前方时\\n一段时间内速度提升＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "70693fa3cdc9fa74fbc219408f1d12abc5c66bff150527d1564f22490791e434",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108602211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d8d661db30ac33b63b8a8e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛开始时\\n一段时间内加速度持续提升＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "08c6b3d671f6bc3c7fa1701b8f001d9a52052ae89c7f3accd468b2835c142d0f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108701111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6be748a84100df56d127c79f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时若身处前方\\n则提升速度\\n并稍微提升加速度＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b068881c9427d27b7b52941747f374d3e2c3910fbf677771e0df41fd1b104052",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108701211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb996686203e6571e20373b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起跑时加速度稍微提升\\n若没有晚出闸,之后在比赛中盘\\n位于前方时一段时间内速度提升＜领放・短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3f601d16516c034c647c4c68aa1a2ed45d9f21f01a002745c7f8367ca610413",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108702111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:502602396fee62107f05aaa1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期若位于前方\\n则更早时间内提升加速度＜领放・短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "07eca1817fd67a26bd7c33a03314b26d9096076225139c6246488ba7d5b5fb93",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108702211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b775d5bfd200b68ed16cb28",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于队伍中后方时\\n速度大幅提升\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d31ed13de9274f64c2f603d0f776221a70a0ab8401360f349229ead9f16ca0fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108801111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd1c952e1a24b68b5cc43f58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段位于中后方时\\n提升加速度,若是2200m～2400m的\\n比赛,则消耗少量体力在终盘初段更早时间内大幅提升加速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "11bd8b18f78b0cc3ece8b3f029f0ca80a524912f573d3a2487de2dad1feb43a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108801211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5478a59b4a07b129520e9a8d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段进行追赶时\\n一段时间内向前突进\\n＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd4f83dc1b14badcbb8b09938400528df8458f890e70949f3e2ce72e37cbe200",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108802111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d167107df37c6d8f5f47ec7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段的弯道进行超越时\\n大幅向前突进,若智力有十二分高超\\n则极大幅向前突进＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "013e7b548786d6eb82bc3dad588a52f6053ac9d1923264a6c837eee1e5ead277",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108802211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e072b59e557cbe76ed69124",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘时若处于前方\\n则少量提升速度与加速度\\n在2400m的比赛中速度提升量增加\\n＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "621d4967cd933179c2eebf0a28f1919da1c7473429dfa72f02c94ed673576c9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108901111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c547e3b09ae64a2dd4935977",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺的关键时刻\\n速度大幅加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "a45ae78773ed10f3b4ac50b7bd0aa0c0b347b26253864644fa1c88a0c606eb97",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108901211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a3706143b7d87986494cdbd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘一段时间内速度提升\\n＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a55cd216c953296387bf6111360e90c517184800b80b9ae108659088ce7571e2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108902111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b379ee9e7788c5eff561f60",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终冲刺的直线上\\n加速度大幅提升,并稍微向前突进\\n＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "af28570e66ee6a85b21ad9ac632405b88fa779cef847e29559561390e11b970c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "108902211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:159fda482981d321f21ddad9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的弯道\\n一段时间内少量提升速度,若是英里比赛\\n则之后在最终直线消耗少量耐力\\n小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "81672d3c054f4057d4a55856feeb3067ff82843b1bfd1ffe4e0b09b570b424a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109001111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2fb9dd9a967c25ed7b86646",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛序盘发动技能时\\n提升加速度,如果是英里比赛则大幅提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9983248c40baf8608ddc40e0952aec32f6acf7cc2d90a3a6bec999c8b291f52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109001211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a03398498d79887bd959c72",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在下坡时速度提升\\n并稍微提升加速度\\n＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6a08a27bb4f8718184339a0f0d16d7f106ef177dafae378e2a34c0eeda43f39",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109101111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c5d543fb9236d02d46307f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段位于队伍中间时\\n一段时间内提升速度\\n并略微提升加速度＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "35785682e05a79b0ace36f328870b92cb2a1216320f956f467dc07e6670c44f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109101211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48c20861cf28da015a85970b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终冲刺的关键时刻\\n速度提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e476209f30cee4f340de0aae87220a3d07c50d4736be90a7d3684e5c25df96d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109102111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27c548592ccfba9fe0cc5bb0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘位于中间位置\\n一段时间内速度提升,若是京都赛场\\n且智力有十二分高超时,技能效果提升\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee607d3bf557504e570923cc8251d3e685d0c625221aed95cabef4c45e9957df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109102211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69615b1953c2a253cb5305ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时若位于前方\\n速度会提升，在中距离比赛中，之后\\n若进行最终冲刺对决则会略微向前冲出\\n＜作战·先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fac7c3d499b0af825d0502b58bfe29ce083dbbd7de832ebf1625e6514ef9ef7d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109201111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:096be7e4f169e1e9fb2349a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘初期会向前冲出\\n并且在中距离比赛中\\n加速力会小幅提升\\n＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "985118af6641d088add73adac5762e84765c8caf5d8650ccf01acd479e76df26",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109201211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaeb811b6cdf419a671ca585",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道位于前方时,速度提升\\n若是短距离比赛\\n则额外向前稍微突进＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "982f78cb73e0d0b5b23b11cc2fe75faa96bef23b6f78f7d9b10b1c0671f52d27",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109301111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57b36eb307359a26cf08c8e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道位于前方时\n持续一段时间提升速度<先行·英里>",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b89945bfa003048b800aecba37424641b6103191459877ce56eea11dfae1023",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109301121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e277892224a73e3f7f628f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段位于前方时提高加速度\\n并在之后剩余200m的位置\\n稍微提升速度＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e91b512f8450cc9ee76c538e5f0eac5436d67ca5168f8228bbea13b6877ca49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109301211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3946aebbd09b12dd9bf7ba1e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘消耗少量耐力\\n使速度大幅提升,若是短距离比赛\\n则不消耗耐力,速度极大提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "30f72d056c41059d317c8d69ceb39a54a0f489bd6514214ea75b71583cfe778e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109302111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10d85d1647a4440e66c8ef89",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "准备超越时速度提升\\n并使包含自身的所有队友\\n稍微向前突进＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c879e51f3f24321de9e55bb905723124b12661d16984328ba6f7bca0fa8dd987",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109302211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ad73155320509ab6e297a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时位于中后方\\n则一段时间内提升速度\\n若力量有十二分强劲\\n则提升技能效果＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "52d372887229fa08838dc74a3baa067be77ddcaeb8b7126a93e1545748808921",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109401111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5650ba997f46b5724a8c8c29",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是东京竞马场比赛,则在比赛终盘初段\\n一段时间内向前突进\\n并略微提升加速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f5e8e973c4b1dba5a886c60d6e0c20123ea6136e56621140db9d075c4bd8850",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109401211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a61886417734991e967c1a6d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段大幅向前突进\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd8fa4e31cb03eb2db2f7426f6ce4d258de377afe7d6311a2f3c6d58a2ba7f8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109401221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:356934613e32efc709056616",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘向前突进，此外\n若发动技能时处于中间集团，则包含自身在内\n的一名队友速度提升\n＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "764737074a63f31101d640c015f631be97aa1f6275d95daab5160e919ce08dee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109402111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58dc84b8e26c07da77adcb9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线上位于第2名以后且距离领头\n4马身以内时极大幅度向前突进\n若比赛中盘曾发生切磋\n则超极大幅度向前突进＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5ea98f522f4233ed6784f9e456b9963ef5e99e9710106877eee891eb98d7451",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109402211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b8d3c045781838e7ef9f7fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的一段时间内速度会提升\\n＜作战·先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "195445c2991f3e40fb37ce28f6308af1ab77b5d3b3b4a980077adcc6e7ada6b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109501111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5f03c1813a173bf23a6213a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的一段时间内速度会提升\\n＜先行·短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d188bc4e2b24e9752607111436da52a9b3f602d8b4c0f993640a6fb99625940",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109501211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a908b70fe85b5133add11fd4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘,在中间集团竞争时\\n少量恢复体力\\n并大幅提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c10a50d09206b2d5221244ace42de693c81aa66640803d07e5c1e0bf38a7ea93",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109601111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e20a4588334a524b747a366",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段大幅向前突进＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "647231218f504ba630b4a9cd974e778fdd5c0884fd333fb8b3b2d051c83523d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109601211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43928044c83c19ae9c0ce427",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "发动「冲动」技能的情况下\\n在最终弯道之前的第3弯道\\n极大幅向前突进＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb2f72176c821e16caea9d5bcc8a622f24b2bdc0dbf8a62a9f59833f31993796",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109701111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:952fe7e689820a08f46870be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入中盘的上坡时大幅向前突进\\n发动「冲动」技能的情况下,之后进入\\n临近终盘的下坡时,小幅向前突进\\n并稍微提升加速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9e5a9a12d979da8854296b9171ba420464d5a0623574ac1566ec9bf22ae84c9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109701211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a552542aa67fa3ea6465ec3",
      "kind": "text_data",
